        "description": "Bugly is an end quality monitoring platform under Tencent Device-oriented Service (TDS), which provides professional quality monitoring services through the core competencies of collection, monitoring, location, and alerts to help developers find and solve quality problems in time and build high-quality applications.",
        "source_link": "https://bugly.qq.com/"
      }
    }
